    <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-emerald-500 mb-10 text-slate-200">
      <p class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Quick Answer for ML Engineers:</p>
      <p>
        For enterprise RAG pipelines, <strong>Cohere Embed v3 (1024-dim)</strong> delivers superior cost-efficiency and out-of-domain retrieval (NDCG@10 of <strong>64.5 vs 62.8</strong>). With native int8 compression, Cohere slashes vector database RAM by <strong>75% (1.02GB vs 12.28GB per 1M vectors)</strong> versus OpenAI 3-large. However, OpenAI's <strong>Matryoshka representation learning</strong> is superior when truncating down to 256 or 512 dimensions without quantization code.
