      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
        Total Cost of Ownership (TCO): API Token Ingestion Pricing at Scale
      </h2>
      <p>
        Evaluating the total cost of an embedding solution requires calculating two independent expense vectors: <strong>Upfront &amp; Recurring API Ingestion Costs</strong> and <strong>Ongoing Vector Database Infrastructure Sizing</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        At the API tier, Cohere charges <strong>$0.10 USD per 1M tokens</strong> for English v3 embeddings across all precision types (float, int8, or binary). OpenAI charges <strong>$0.13 USD per 1M tokens</strong> for text-embedding-3-large, regardless of whether you request 3072 dimensions or truncate down to 1024 or 256 dimensions. At an ingestion scale of 500 million tokens per month (typical for an enterprise processing 1.5 million support tickets, PDF contracts, and internal documentation pages):
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
        <li><strong>Cohere Embed v3 Annual API Cost</strong>: <code>500 * $0.10 * 12 months = $600 USD / year</code></li>
        <li><strong>OpenAI 3-Large Annual API Cost</strong>: <code>500 * $0.13 * 12 months = $780 USD / year</code> ($180 premium)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
